# Aerogel simulator — project handover

Build a simulation tool for the aerogel part of a multifunctional CFRP thermal-management project. Start with a simple directional aerogel model, then extend it to the laminate.

## A. ZIP structure and reading order

| Path | Contents |
|---|---|
| `summary.md` | This short roadmap; `summary.nd` is an identical copy |
| `01_Project/` | Original project proposal |
| `02_Experiment/` | Original experiment Word guide, text extraction and unresolved parameter issues |
| `03_Context/` | Retained project history and earlier decisions |
| `04_Simulation/` | Already-extracted meeting requirements and current build brief |
| `05_References/` | Main reference, supporting-paper records, reading notes, links and available PDFs |
